# This project compiles *.cpp files (at root and under examples/) into Unix
# executables with the same base name and no extension (not *.exe - that's a
# Windows PE suffix, and these are Mach-O binaries from e.g.
# `g++ examples/playground.cpp -o examples/playground`).
# So instead of listing every binary by name: ignore everything, then
# un-ignore anything that has an extension, plus directories. No leading
# slash, so this applies at every directory depth, not just the root.
*
!*.*
!*/

test.cpp
playground.cpp
tempCodeRunnerFile.cpp

# ...then re-ignore specific dotted files/dirs that are still noise
tempCodeRunnerFile.cpp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Generic C/C++ build output, in case a build system gets added later
*.o
*.obj
*.out
*.exe
*.dSYM/
*.pch
*.gch
*.ilk
*.pdb
build/
out/
cmake-build-*/
